15.1 Before you begin
=====================

This tutorial takes you from your first coloured page to a setup that
suits you.  Each step says what to do and what you should see.  If you
want to look up what an option means, the manual (‘M-x bltzread-manual’)
has all of them.

   You need:

   • Emacs with bltzread loaded (your init file already does this).
   • bltzr installed, with at least one language (check with ‘bltzr
     list-languages’).
   • Optional: sdcv and a StarDict dictionary, for the word cards.


