15.5.3 Change a key
-------------------

The single keys work only while the buffer is read-only, so they never
get in the way of typing.  To move or remove one:
     (keymap-unset bltzread-mode-map "N" t)
     (keymap-set bltzread-mode-map "n" (bltzread-when-read-only #'bltzread-note))
   The rarer commands follow the prefix ‘bltzread-prefix-key’ (default
‘s’, so ‘s 3’); set it to another key in Customize, or to nil for none.


